{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f2be0535de1ec587c69cf08e2d2a165420b861591c1041f8621ca48f6995946e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:528173b6ed9d8528911d2f6bc098bc6d4de9cfad0329c81c158f6b6f93f9041a",
      "text": "初次见面。\n家祖承蒙各位一直以来的关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b20a8d3f21bdc37dbd949febf8a4e9377a4f1e5fc8b0a1e96b79482c116177f",
      "text": "是的，托大家的福。\n今后也请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6015af5330732d0206658a6df348771fda22c249face795b86e87727d95945c2",
      "text": "（不管和谁说话，都是大同小异的客套……\n虽然在这样的场合也是无可奈何）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6eb8ef519abcd7b997d501da855d5083644c0f54e90dc1d41ead314eb134b7c",
      "text": "那么老师。\n改日我们定当再次登门相邀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b656d904357dc0a31dc43a25ca403b505a88ffb6d73f3a5f170db5257788ce",
      "text": "（祖父邀请的人，也总是固定那几位。\n我明明希望让更多的人接触到茶道）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fc6dc4833588528893864e24637ec64e077ab01d6611c545e7e58b1afe9d91c",
      "text": "哎呀，真是好久不见了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f2c4f3c5b98edfabaffac524bf559411255133dbf341d834d0e6f49c365971",
      "text": "（这位我记得是，落语家的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:789a4e1a96f492b271b569f238f268b66a1f0656f94a808a0c3b492251f8bd18",
      "text": "最近如何啊？近来可好？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a7b65b9614598a2c070a3dc0075f5f5e704c8d8a5879e36c17a7743a8423d8",
      "text": "最近有个挺有意思的小家伙呢。\n对了，年纪大概和九郎君差不多吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe36b46c45fc7e1c3a1e5ef7a90eb0ef28f63778701bdf9239d8393227af64e4",
      "text": "有个孩子以破纪录的速度晋升到了二目呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d106c248c3f7702d1a0e60fda1e9cf1cfb06422ecc82e6471bea92ce1398a58",
      "text": "（哎……和我差不多的年纪，就升到了二目……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
